    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "https://www.bitchute.com/video/hIVKL4VwnL0V/\n\nSomeone I guess wanting to be an independent news reporter. Seems like he or she is getting a good start ... posts many reports everyday for a small audience.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@b.c.begley6007/videos",
    "media": "1780.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 1781,
    "date": "2023-04-01T13:43:07+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "Here is our problem.  \n\nThe illusion of freedom is becoming very un-profitable to maintain.  The truth of our situation will be revealed to all people and there will be crying and gnashing of teeth. People will be slow then quick to realize they are simply slaves within a corrupt system.  \n\nHow will you ever hope to change government?  It will continue to grow and grow, unless we the people put an end to it.   Who among us wants to be among the subversive type?  Very few, and many are finding themselves in a heap of trouble.  \n\nWhat about you?  \n\nThe party is over and all we have to do is go home or look at is the back of the stage.  Where will you go next?\n\nFrank Zappa was alright, just a little crazy and outspoken with his artwork.",
    "media": "1781.jpg"
  },
